  ["Show your on-use trinkets (off-GCD badge on slot 1) when they are ready, with your cooldowns, in combat."] = "战斗中主动饰品就绪时与大技能一起显示（第 1 格上不占公共冷却的徽标）。",
  ["SimC default (300 s bosses, short trash)"] = "SimC 默认（首领 300 秒，小怪较短）",
  ["SimC holds or uses cooldowns by how long the fight lasts. Learned: the typical length of your recent fights of the same kind (open world, dungeon/raid trash, bosses, PvP); SimC's defaults until it has 5."] = "SimC 会根据战斗时长保留或使用大技能。学习：你最近同类战斗（野外、地下城/团队小怪、首领、PvP）的典型时长；满 5 场之前使用 SimC 默认值。",
  ["SimulationCraft publishes no rotation for most healing specs (Discipline, Holy Priest, Holy Paladin, Mistweaver, Restoration Shaman, Preservation). For those DMGAssist has its own damage lists, learned from the current class guides, for your damage between heals (SimC's list replaces ours as soon as it publishes one). Healing stays your call. Interrupts, defensives with your boss mod, on-use trinkets, keybinds and your spell choices all work. Restoration Druid has a full SimC list, including cat weaving. A spec with no list at all (some on WoW Forever) follows Blizzard's Assisted Combat."] = "SimulationCraft 没有为大多数治疗专精（戒律、神圣牧师、神圣圣骑士、织雾、恢复萨满、恩护）发布循环。DMGAssist 为它们准备了自己的输出列表，取自当前的职业指南，用于治疗间隙的输出（SimC 一旦发布列表就会替换我们的）。治疗仍由你决定。打断、配合首领插件的减伤、饰品、按键和你的技能选择都能用。恢复德鲁伊有完整的 SimC 列表，包括猫形态输出。完全没有列表的专精（部分怀旧服专精）跟随暴雪的辅助战斗。",
  ["Single target"] = "单体",
  ["Size, as a percentage of slot 1."] = "大小，占第 1 格的百分比。",
  ["Skip the spell in slot 1 three times and it is held for the rest of the fight (\"saving it\"). Cast it yourself and it comes back. Only spells with a real cooldown are held."] = "把第 1 格的技能跳过三次，它会在本场战斗剩余时间内被保留（“留着”）。你自己施放后它会回来。只有真正有冷却的技能才会被保留。",
  ["Skip the spell in the first slot three times and it is held until combat ends. Cast it yourself to bring it back."] = "把第一格的技能跳过三次，它会保留到战斗结束。你自己施放即可恢复。",
